<concept id="t00253">
	<title id="e01617">Air bag warning light <image align="left" href="images/WKIA_027.jpg" scale="15" placement="inline"/></title>
	<prolog>
		<metadata>
			<keywords>
				<indexterm>air bag
					<indexterm>warning and indicator</indexterm>
				</indexterm>
			</keywords>
		</metadata>
	</prolog>
	<conbody>
		<section deliveryTarget="except_print" id="e01618">
			<title>Operating condition(s)</title>
			<ul id="e01619">
				<li>
					<p>When the vehicle is running, the air bag warning light appears for approximately 3–6 seconds and then turns off.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
		<section id="e01620">
			<title>Malfunction</title>
			<ul id="e01621">
				<li>
					<p>The air bag warning light does not turn on briefly when the vehicle is running.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>The air bag warning light stays on after it illuminates for approximately 3–6 seconds.</p>
				</li>
				<li>
					<p>The air bag warning light comes on while the vehicle is moving.</p>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</conbody>
